ites you to question, reflect, and think differently about the world around you. Designed as an evolving prototype, *World of Wonder* challenges your thinking through interactive moments that spark inquiry and imagination. Future versions will expand these experiences, empowering participants to explore real-world problems and imagine innovative solutions.\n", "short_description": "Step into the shoes of Alice and journey through a wonderland of immersive moments that provoke inquiry and challenge your thinking about the world around you. Question, reflect, and think differently as curiosity leads your way."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://avc.web.usf.edu/app-policies/WorldOfWonder/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Lindsay Persohn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://avc.web.usf.edu/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25435021996135234"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "791306806999895"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "791306806999895"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1763995440, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "791306806999895"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "